            <ATT name="Content"><![CDATA[#Wed Sep 30 08:07:56 CEST 2026
graphRagFuzzyThreshold=0.92
graphRagGroup=governance
graphRagReviewBand=0.75
graphRagExtractionHints=Organisations appear on the cover page ('Prepared by', 'Published by', 'Edition \:', 'Prepared for'), in the document control table ('Created By', 'Reviewed By', 'Approved By' followed by a name and an organisation), in copyright lines and in the text as the owner, operator, vendor or maintainer of a system ('maintained by DIT-T', 'hébergé chez Digital Ocean'). Use the full name as name and put the acronym in acronym; when only an acronym is printed, use it as the name.
graphRagMatch=fuzzy
]]></ATT>
            <ATT name="status">1970354901745664</ATT>
          </ATTRIBUTES>
